{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜立法會討論非專營巴士持續發展等／香港國際警務學院開幕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261111.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會會議今日(11月11日)討論非專營巴士持續發展，以及優化電話卡實名登記制等議題。另外，香港國際警務學院開幕典禮，由行政長官李家超主持，保安局局長鄧炳強和警務處處長周一鳴主禮。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:08:58.197644+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:26:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:29:11.798158+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:02:37.698333+00:00","content_hash":"ae05ce94ec65ca4df7e705fe4e72719b6f3acf272fcda959a11367fafe8d2012","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:08:58.197644+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}